WEBVTT

00:12:55.746 --> 00:13:01.537
So there's quite a big difference in
male and female characteristics.

00:13:01.829 --> 00:13:03.496
And that's the same with humans.

00:13:03.496 --> 00:13:09.579
And this is what bothers me as we
move into the era of feminism,

00:13:10.162 --> 00:13:16.246
is that the females who first succeeded
in breaking into male business

00:13:16.246 --> 00:13:17.704
and politics, for example,

00:13:18.204 --> 00:13:23.579
did so by trying to become more male than
the males used the same tactics.

00:13:24.204 --> 00:13:28.954
Whereas what we need in our society
is the two different,

00:13:29.621 --> 00:13:34.704
the male and the female who who do have
different ways of doing things.